{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id232036327"}, "name":{"label":"jb86appuser"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-28T07:21:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.08.30"}, "id":{"label":"14482258862"}, "title":{"label":"Meh"}, "content":{"label":"Slack is fine, but overall, we’d be better without it. My biggest complaint is that, as a busy executive who travels often, slack’s performance on anything other than a perfect internet connection is terrible to non existent. The amount of producing I lose by not being able to use it on a poor airplane WiFi connection (when email, I message, etc all work) is infuriating. The lack of productivity tools to sort, filter and organize messages is the other big problem. I always ask people if they like slack in interviews. Show me someone who likes slack, and I’ll show you someone who doesn’t care about being productive. So in that regard, it’s a useful way to screen people.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=618783545&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
